display_name = "Scarab Ward"
description = "Passive: while worn, one blow in four glances off you."
lore = "Old Ammar carves them from blue faience, one a week, and won't sell to anyone who haggles. 'The scarab rolls the sun across the sky,' he says. 'It can roll a blow aside.'"
